{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to hit The Junkyard tracks in <strong>Rust &amp; Roll</strong>, the ultimate racing game where your ride is as good as your scavenging\u00a0skills!. Drive into the chaotic world of junkyard racing, where every vehicle you find can be a diamond in the rough.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Vehicles:</strong>\u00a0Start with cars in various sates of disrepair and turn them into racing machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Scavenge parts and modify your vehicles to enhance performance and style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you transform trash into treasure and dominate the <strong>Rust &amp; Roll</strong> circuits? Buckle up and find out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452850?t=1748451918","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452850?t=1748451918","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452850/be97ecdf9e157825f3f0f08b69a312519c1d7690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748451918","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452850/be97ecdf9e157825f3f0f08b69a312519c1d7690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748451918","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to hit The Junkyard tracks in <strong>Rust &amp; Roll</strong>, the ultimate racing game where your ride is as good as your scavenging\u00a0skills!. Drive int